{
  "name": "03 - Order Creation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node_trigger",
      "name": "Workflow Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        180,
        400
      ],
      "notes": "يُستدعى من '02 - WhatsApp AI Conversation' بثلاثة أوضاع: mode=create (أول تأكيد شراء)، mode=continue (استكمال بيانات عميل)، أو mode=select_payment (اختيار طريقة الدفع).",
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "workflowInputs",
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "mode",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "conversation_id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "wa_id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "message_id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "active_order_id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "variant_id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "customer_name",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "customer_phone",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "customer_address",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "payment_method_type",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_if_create_mode",
      "name": "Is Create Mode?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.mode}}",
              "value2": "create",
              "operation": "equal"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_get_conversation",
      "name": "Get Conversation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        620,
        160
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1500,
      "notes": "نقطة نهاية أساسية بسيطة (GET /conversations/{id}) تُعيد المحادثة مع بيانات العميل المرتبط بها (customer.id + ما هو معروف عنه مسبقاً).",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{$env.API_BASE_URL}}/conversations/{{$('Workflow Trigger').item.json.conversation_id}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{$env.BACKEND_API_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_create_order",
      "name": "Create Order",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        840,
        160
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1500,
      "notes": "كمية افتراضية = 1. لا يُرسل أي سعر من n8n. محمي بـ Idempotency-Key فريد لكل رسالة تأكيد شراء.",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$env.API_BASE_URL}}/orders",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{$env.BACKEND_API_TOKEN}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "=create-order-{{$('Workflow Trigger').item.json.conversation_id}}-{{$('Workflow Trigger').item.json.message_id}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"customer_id\": $('Get Conversation').item.json.customer.id, \"conversation_id\": $('Workflow Trigger').item.json.conversation_id, \"items\": [ { \"variant_id\": $('Workflow Trigger').item.json.variant_id, \"quantity\": 1 } ] } }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_set_active_order_context",
      "name": "Set Active Order In Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1060,
        160
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1500,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$env.API_BASE_URL}}/conversations/{{$('Workflow Trigger').item.json.conversation_id}}/context",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{$env.BACKEND_API_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"active_order_id\": $json.id } }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_if_select_payment_mode",
      "name": "Is Select Payment Mode?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.mode}}",
              "value2": "select_payment",
              "operation": "equal"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_determine_order_id",
      "name": "Determine Order Id",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1280,
        400
      ],
      "notes": "عقدة التقاء آمنة (create أو continue) — يمكن الإشارة إليها لاحقاً بأمان دائماً.",
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "let order_id;\ntry {\n  order_id = $('Create Order').item.json.id;\n} catch (e) {\n  order_id = $('Workflow Trigger').item.json.active_order_id;\n}\nreturn [{ json: { order_id } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_build_patch",
      "name": "Build Customer Data Patch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        400
      ],
      "notes": "يبني فقط الحقول الواردة فعلاً في هذه الرسالة — لا يمحو بيانات محفوظة مسبقاً.",
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const trigger = $('Workflow Trigger').item.json;\nconst patch = {};\nif (trigger.customer_name) patch.full_name = trigger.customer_name;\nif (trigger.customer_phone) patch.phone = trigger.customer_phone;\nif (trigger.customer_address) patch.address = trigger.customer_address;\n\nreturn [{ json: { order_id: $json.order_id, patch } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_patch_order",
      "name": "Patch Order Customer Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1720,
        400
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1500,
      "notes": "التوقع: يعيد الطلب متضمناً customer.full_name / customer.phone / shipping_address.",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{$env.API_BASE_URL}}/orders/{{$json.order_id}}/customer-data",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{$env.BACKEND_API_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{$json.patch}}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_check_missing",
      "name": "Check Missing Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1940,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const order = $input.item.json;\nconst missing = [];\nif (!order.customer || !order.customer.full_name) missing.push('name');\nif (!order.customer || !order.customer.phone) missing.push('phone');\nif (!order.shipping_address) missing.push('address');\n\nreturn [{ json: { order, missing } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_if_complete",
      "name": "All Customer Data Complete?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2160,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.missing.length}}",
              "value2": 0,
              "operation": "equal"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_get_payment_methods",
      "name": "Get Payment Methods",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2380,
        260
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{$env.API_BASE_URL}}/payment-methods",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{$env.BACKEND_API_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_build_payment_message",
      "name": "Build Payment Options Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2600,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const methods = $input.item.json;\nconst enabled = Array.isArray(methods) ? methods.filter(m => m.is_enabled) : [];\n\nconst labels = { bank_transfer: 'تحويل بنكي', cash_on_delivery: 'الدفع عند الاستلام' };\nconst optionsList = enabled.map((m, i) => `${i + 1}. ${labels[m.type] || m.type}`).join('\\n');\n\nconst text = `وصلتنا بياناتك بالكامل ✅\\nطرق الدفع المتاحة:\\n${optionsList}\\n\\nأي طريقة تفضل؟`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { reply_text: text, enabled_methods: enabled } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_send_payment_options",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp - Payment Options",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        2820,
        260
      ],
      "notes": "يستدعي '00 - Send WhatsApp Message (Shared)' — يتبدّل تلقائياً بين API الرسمي والعقدة الاحتياطية حسب WHATSAPP_PROVIDER.",
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "00 - Send WhatsApp Message (Shared)"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "to": "={{$('Workflow Trigger').item.json.wa_id}}",
            "message_text": "={{$json.reply_text}}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_build_missing_message",
      "name": "Build Missing Fields Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2380,
        540
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const missing = $json.missing;\nconst labels = { name: 'الاسم الكامل', phone: 'رقم الهاتف', address: 'العنوان بالتفصيل' };\nconst missingLabels = missing.map(m => labels[m]);\n\nlet text;\nif (missingLabels.length === 1) {\n  text = `تمام! بقي بس ${missingLabels[0]} لإتمام طلبك 🙏`;\n} else {\n  text = `تمام! بقي نحتاج منك:\\n${missingLabels.map((l, i) => `${i + 1}. ${l}`).join('\\n')}\\nلإتمام طلبك 🙏`;\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { reply_text: text } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_send_missing_data",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp - Ask Missing Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        2600,
        540
      ],
      "notes": "يستدعي '00 - Send WhatsApp Message (Shared)' — يتبدّل تلقائياً بين API الرسمي والعقدة الاحتياطية حسب WHATSAPP_PROVIDER.",
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "00 - Send WhatsApp Message (Shared)"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "to": "={{$('Workflow Trigger').item.json.wa_id}}",
            "message_text": "={{$json.reply_text}}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_get_payment_methods_selection",
      "name": "Get Payment Methods For Selection",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        840,
        640
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{$env.API_BASE_URL}}/payment-methods",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{$env.BACKEND_API_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_resolve_chosen_method",
      "name": "Resolve Chosen Payment Method",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1060,
        640
      ],
      "notes": "يفترض أن الـ AI طبّع اختيار العميل الحر (مثلاً 'حولة بنكية') إلى إحدى القيم الثابتة: bank_transfer | cash_on_delivery.",
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const methods = $input.item.json;\nconst chosenType = $('Workflow Trigger').item.json.payment_method_type;\nconst match = Array.isArray(methods) ? methods.find(m => m.is_enabled && m.type === chosenType) : null;\n\nreturn [{ json: { found: !!match, method: match || null, all_enabled: Array.isArray(methods) ? methods.filter(m => m.is_enabled) : [] } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_if_method_found",
      "name": "Payment Method Found?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1280,
        640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.found}}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_patch_payment_method",
      "name": "Patch Order Payment Method",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        580
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "notes": "تعيين payment_method_id على الطلب — آمن للتكرار بطبيعته. نقطة نهاية تكميلية صغيرة (PATCH /orders/{id}/payment-method) بنفس روح PATCH /orders/{id}/customer-data.",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{$env.API_BASE_URL}}/orders/{{$('Workflow Trigger').item.json.active_order_id}}/payment-method",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{$env.BACKEND_API_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"payment_method_id\": $json.method.id } }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_if_bank_transfer",
      "name": "Is Bank Transfer?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1720,
        580
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$('Resolve Chosen Payment Method').item.json.method.type}}",
              "value2": "bank_transfer",
              "operation": "equal"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_build_iban_message",
      "name": "Build IBAN Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1940,
        500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const method = $('Resolve Chosen Payment Method').item.json.method;\nconst iban = (method.details && method.details.iban) ? method.details.iban : '(يرجى مراجعة الأدمن للحصول على رقم الحساب)';\n\nconst text = `لإتمام طلبك، يرجى تحويل المبلغ إلى حساب IBAN التالي:\\n${iban}\\n\\nبعد التحويل أرسل لنا صورة أو ملف إثبات التحويل هنا ليتم مراجعة الطلب.`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { reply_text: text } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_send_iban_message",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp - IBAN Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        2160,
        500
      ],
      "notes": "يستدعي '00 - Send WhatsApp Message (Shared)' — يتبدّل تلقائياً بين API الرسمي والعقدة الاحتياطية حسب WHATSAPP_PROVIDER.",
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "00 - Send WhatsApp Message (Shared)"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "to": "={{$('Workflow Trigger').item.json.wa_id}}",
            "message_text": "={{$json.reply_text}}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_build_cod_message",
      "name": "Build COD Confirmation Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1940,
        660
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const text = 'تم تسجيل طلبك للدفع عند الاستلام ✅ سنراجع الطلب ونتواصل معك لتأكيد التفاصيل والشحن.';\nreturn [{ json: { reply_text: text } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_send_cod_message",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp - COD Confirmation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        2160,
        660
      ],
      "notes": "يستدعي '00 - Send WhatsApp Message (Shared)' — يتبدّل تلقائياً بين API الرسمي والعقدة الاحتياطية حسب WHATSAPP_PROVIDER.",
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "00 - Send WhatsApp Message (Shared)"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "to": "={{$('Workflow Trigger').item.json.wa_id}}",
            "message_text": "={{$json.reply_text}}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_build_invalid_payment_message",
      "name": "Build Invalid Payment Choice Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        780
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const enabled = $json.all_enabled || [];\nconst labels = { bank_transfer: 'تحويل بنكي', cash_on_delivery: 'الدفع عند الاستلام' };\nconst optionsList = enabled.map((m, i) => `${i + 1}. ${labels[m.type] || m.type}`).join('\\n');\n\nconst text = `عذراً، ما قدرنا نطابق هالطريقة مع الخيارات المتاحة حالياً:\\n${optionsList}\\n\\nأي وحدة منها تفضل؟`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { reply_text: text } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_send_invalid_payment_message",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp - Invalid Payment Choice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1720,
        780
      ],
      "notes": "يستدعي '00 - Send WhatsApp Message (Shared)' — يتبدّل تلقائياً بين API الرسمي والعقدة الاحتياطية حسب WHATSAPP_PROVIDER.",
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
